kart's drift boost building (1 blue, 2 orange)\n1312:- `car.drifting = 0`: -1 left, 1 right, 0 not\n1313:- `car.o`: its options\n1314:- `car.offroad = false`: on a surface that slows it","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AnMMAFf79RXjsm4Eqxzsgq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
