eturn;\\n    if (Dev.isOpen()) { Dev.update(dt); if (!Dev.live) return; }\"\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,\"    const m = Match.m; if (!m) return;\\n    if (Dev.isOpen()) { Dev.update(dt); if (!Dev.live) return; }\\n    else if (game.paused) return;\")\nio.open(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Skip updates while engine menus are open"}}}
