ycles to ALL ON', 'FACE OFF starts the exhibition with the human on HOME', 'the exhibition match has every unlocked cheat on', '15 stars unlock all 5 cheats', '3 stars unlock Big Heads only', 'Always KABOOM keeps the human team in KABOOM', 'Octopus Rain throws octopi', 'finishing the Cup Run unlocks the Grizzlies for exhibition']],\n  ['Scope: Practice (every mechanic taught)', \"Coach Marge's 7 drills (src/47-scene-practice.js)\", ['drill 1 (WHEELS) passes', 'drill 2 (TAPE TO TAPE) passes', 'drill 3 (TOP SHELF) passes', 'drill 4 (ONE-TIMERS) passes', 'drill 5 (FINISH YOUR CHECK) passes', 'drill 6 (GLOVES OFF) passes', 'drill 7 (KABOOM!) passes', 'Practice: the carousel moves to drill 3', 'Practice: confirm starts that drill', 'all 7 drills earn Marge Approved']],\n  ['Scope: the Flood Wagon intermission', 'src/44-scene-flood.js', ['a good driver floods a perfect sheet', 'a perfect flood gives the team BOOM +30', 'a driver who does nothing gets no perfect flood and no bonus', 'the Flood Wagon was driven at an intermission']],\n  ['Scope: Records', 'src/37-save.js, 48-scene-info.js', ['Records: the hardest shot', 'Records: the biggest hit', 'Records: most goals in a game', 'Records: fights won', 'Records: KABOOMs', 'Records: games and wins', 'the Records screen pages']],\n  ['Dev mode from the pause menu, the standard testing tools', 'src/70-dev.js (TUNING, CHEATS, WARP, DEBUG)', ['the pause menu has a Dev Mode item', 'Dev Mode opens the panel and holds the match', 'a cheat toggles', 'warp: start a fight', 'LIVE runs the game behind the panel']],\n  ['Balance: the key variables as live sliders, with a reset to defaults', 'T (src/03-tuning.js), 50 sliders', ['a slider changes its value', 'a tuning value applies live', '△ resets the row', 'RESET ALL TO DEFAULTS restores every value']],\n  ['Attract mode: after 10 s idle on title/menus, a looping AI demo; any input exits', 'src/41-scene-attract.js', ['10 s idle starts the attract mode', 'attract segment drop plays', 'attract segment kaboom plays', 'attract segment story plays', 'the reel loops', 'any input returns to the title', 'storymap: 10 s idle starts the attract mode', 'a match never goes to attract']],\n  ['Narrative tone: the source\\'s style', 'Booth commentary, chirps, tips, cutscenes (src/07-data-text.js, 06-data-story.js)', ['commentary: 110+ lines', 'chirps: 30+', 'every commentary token resolves', 'the story validates']],\n  ['UI/UX: controller-first, 10-foot; keyboard and mouse native; mouse hover focuses and clicks pick', 'src/12-ui.js, 11-glyphs.js; HOCKEY_KEYS (00-head.js)', ['a key opens the main menu', 'arrows move the focus', 'hovering a tile focuses it', 'a click picks the tile (PRACTICE)', 'the keyboard shows keycaps']],\n  ['Prompts follow the device used last; PlayStation glyphs with an Xbox option in Settings', 'src/11-glyphs.js; Settings: Button symbols', ['a pad shows PlayStation symbols by default', 'Settings, Button symbols: Xbox shows A and X', 'the mouse shows mouse prompts', 'pass on a pad shows ✕', 'shoot with the mouse shows the left click', 'the engine settings screen lists Button symbols']],\n  ['No overly dense web-style data screens', 'Big tiles and cards, at most 6 choices, big-number records (screenshots in shots/)', ['the Records screen opens with two pages', 'results show three stars']],\n  ['Touch-only devices: no touch controls; \"Controller or keyboard required\" and the settings button; attract runs', 'src/40-scene-title.js, 90-start.js (touchOnly)', ['touch-only is detected', 'touch-only: the title shows a SETTINGS button', 'touch-only: taps do not start the game', 'touch-only: the attract mode runs after 10 s']],\n  ['Settings options, each read live', 'SETTINGS (src/00-head.js)', ['Settings: Commentary Off silences the booth', 'Settings: Subtitles Off keeps the box closed', 'Settings: Voices volume sets the voice bus', 'Settings: Player intros Off', 'Settings: Replays Off shows no replay', 'Settings: Flood Wagon Never skips it', 'Settings: Flood Wagon Always drives it without asking', 'Settings: Tips Off shows none', 'Settings: Reset tips forgets the seen tips', 'Settings: Difficulty sets the CPU skill', 'Settings: Period length is the exhibition default']],\n  ['Done: no TODOs, placeholders or stubbed features', 'The built game script is scanned', ['no \"TODO\" in the game', 'no \"FIXME\" in the game', 'no \"placeholder\" in the game', 'no \"stub(\" in the game', 'no \"lorem\" in the game']],\n  ['Source Information, Testing/Engine/Prompt Feedback in the reply and an in-game About/Credits screen', 'About pages (src/48-scene-info.js) built from tools/interview.mjs, the same text as exit-interview.json', ['About has every section', 'About: Source Information has all 15 fields', 'About: Testing Feedback matches the exit interview', 'About: Engine and Prompt Feedback match']]\n];\nlet bad = 0; const lines = ['# TASK.md audit', '', 'Last full run: ' + run.at + ' — ' + run.passed + ' passed, ' + run.failed + ' failed (`node tests/run.mjs`). Each requirement lists its checks; every one passed in that run.', '', '| # | TASK.md requirement | Where the code meets it | Checks (passed) |', '|---|---|---|---|'];\nR.forEach(([req, where, checks], i) => { const miss = checks.filter(c => !has(c)); if (miss.length) bad++; lines.push('| ' + (i + 1) + ' | ' + req + ' | ' + where + ' | ' + checks.map(c => (has(c) ? '✓ ' : '✗ ') + c.replace(/\\|/g, '/')).join('<br>') + ' |'); if (miss.length) console.log('MISSING for \"' + req + '\": ' + miss.join(' | ')); });\n// the exit interview, field by field\nconst ij = JSON.parse(rd('../exit-interview.json')), si = ['date', 'source', 'plan', 'genre', 'perspective', 'tech', 'artDirection', 'animation', 'audio', 'online', 'testing', 'research', 'environment', 'model', 'usage'], ai = ['name', 'tagline', 'description', 'type', 'genre', 'source', 'series', 'players', 'controls', 'tags'];\nconst ijOk = si.every(k => typeof ij.sourceInformation[k] === 'string' && ij.sourceInformation[k].length) && ij.testingFeedback.length === 4 && ij.engineFeedback.length === 6 && ij.promptFeedback.length === 4 && ai.every(k => k in ij.aiHub) && ij.aiHub.tags.length >= 3 && ij.aiHub.tags.length <= 6;\nlines.push('', 'exit-interview.json: parses; ' + si.length + ' Source Information fields, 4 testing, 6 engine and 4 prompt answers, ' + ai.length + ' AI Hub fields: ' + (ijOk ? 'all answered' : 'MISSING FIELDS') + '.');\nlines.push('', 'Deliverable: ' + (existsSync(new URL('../IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-182647.html', root)) ? 'IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-182647.html exists in the folder root.' : 'MISSING'));\nwriteFileSync(new URL('TASK-AUDIT.md', root), lines.join('\\n') + '\\n');\nconsole.log(lines.slice(6).map(l => l.replace(/<br>/g, '; ')).join('\\n').split('\\n').map(l => l.length > 240 ? l.slice(0, 237) + '...' : l).join('\\n'));\nconsole.log('\\nTASK.md AUDIT: ' + (R.length - bad) + ' of ' + R.length + ' requirements met by passing checks; exit interview ' + (ijOk ? 'complete' : 'INCOMPLETE'));\nprocess.exit(bad || !ijOk ? 1 : 0);\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport io\np='tools/interview.mjs'; s=io.open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"The final full run: 255 checks passing, 0 failing.\",\"The final full run: 303 checks passing, 0 failing, and a line-by-line TASK.md audit (TASK-AUDIT.md) with every requirement met by passing checks.\")\ns=s.replace(\"headless Node suites (systems and units, features (the boss rules, unlocks, the Flood Wagon), text,\",\"headless Node suites (systems and units, features (the boss rules, unlocks, the Flood Wagon), extras (records, practice, every setting, the lab, audio), text,\")\ns=s.replace(\"Session time: about 3 h 45 min (18:26 to about 22:10)\",\"Session time: about 4 h (18:26 to about 22:25)\")\nio.open(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/interview.mjs && export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp && (timeout 3000 node tests/run.mjs > .tmp/run5.log 2>&1; echo \"EXIT $?\" >> .tmp/run5.log) & echo started","description":"Write the audit tool; run the full suite"}}}
